<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
        <%- include('partials/flash') %>

            <main class="about-wrapper">
                <!-- HOTSTAR-STYLE STORY HERO STAGE -->
                <section class="about-hero-card">
                    <div class="about-hero-backdrop"></div>
                    <div class="about-overlay-left"></div>
                    <div class="about-overlay-bottom"></div>

                    <div class="about-hero-content">
                        <div class="hero-tags">
                            <span class="hotstar-pill origin-pill">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <h1 class="glitch-title" data-text="THE ATX STORY">
                            THE ATX <span class="gold-text">STORY</span>
                        </h1>

                        <p class="hero-subtitle">
                            Arena Team Xtreme: More than an elite gaming GC - an unbreakable digital brotherhood
                            forged across battles, triumphs, and shared memories.
                        </p>

                        <div class="hero-meta-strip">
                            <span class="meta-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad cyan-text"></i> WEREWOLF ROOTS
                            </span>
                            <span class="meta-dot">•</span>
                            <span class="meta-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart gold-text"></i> BROTHERHOOD & CODE
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- NARRATIVE DIRECTIVE GRID -->
                <div class="about-grid">
                    <!-- Card 1: Origins -->
                    <article class="cyber-card story-card">
                        <div class="hud-corner tl"></div>
                        <div class="hud-corner br"></div>

                        <div class="card-header-bar">
                            <span class="card-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-dna gold-text"></i> ORIGINS</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chess-knight card-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>Forged in Werewolf</h2>
                        <p>
                            <strong>ATX (Arena Team Xtreme)</strong> is more than just a squad on Plato. It is an
                            enduring bond that was conceived through <span>Werewolf</span> strategy and evolved into
                            something far deeper than an ordinary competitive team.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            From the beginning, ATX was built around tactical mastery, bringing together analytical
                            minds who loved reading opponents, orchestrating plans, and calculating moves. Over time,
                            those late-night matches cemented unconditional trust and real lifelong friendships.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 2: Core Values -->
                    <article class="cyber-card story-card">
                        <div class="hud-corner tl"></div>
                        <div class="hud-corner br"></div>

                        <div class="card-header-bar">
                            <span class="card-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-simple gold-text"></i> CODE &
                                ETHOS</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat card-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>Beyond Victory</h2>
                        <p>
                            In ATX, our focus extends far beyond the leaderboard podium. It is about standing together
                            through every clutch round, backing each member's judgment, and learning from defeats as a
                            unified collective.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Even when match adrenaline spikes and tensions run high, <strong>mutual respect never
                                wavers</strong>. Minor disagreements are resolved with integrity, maturity, and genuine
                            brotherhood — that is what makes our armor impenetrable.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 3: Culture -->
                    <article class="cyber-card story-card full-width">
                        <div class="hud-corner tl"></div>
                        <div class="hud-corner br"></div>

                        <div class="card-header-bar">
                            <span class="card-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles gold-text"></i> COMMUNITY &
                                CULTURE</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-crown card-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>A Culture of Appreciation</h2>
                        <p>
                            The lifeblood of ATX is our culture of active appreciation. We champion individual effort,
                            support daily improvement, and elevate each other's milestones. Nobody is overlooked, and
                            every single member has the runway to shine.
                        </p>

                        <div class="feature-pills">
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy gold-text"></i> Premium Tournaments</span>
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad cyan-text"></i> Community Game
                                Nights</span>
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-danger"></i> Unbreakable Loyalty</span>
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-music text-purple"></i> Music Lounges</span>
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            From major seasonal championships to spontaneous casual game nights, we have crafted
                            countless unforgettable memories charged with laughter, rivalry, and camaraderie.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Dedicated Community Appreciation Section -->
                    <div class="community-tribute full-width">
                        <div class="tribute-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown gold-text"></i> WE SALUTE</div>
                        <p class="tribute-lead">
                            ATX Family is a premier digital arena and competitive gaming ecosystem.
                        </p>
                        <p class="tribute-body">
                            To every Admin, veteran, <span>Pro</span>, and enthusiastic <span>Newcomer</span> who
                            powers this community forward:
                            <strong>We couldn't do it without you.</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Manifesto Banner -->
                    <div class="manifesto-banner full-width">
                        <div class="quote-ambient-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i>
                        </div>
                        <blockquote class="about-quote">
                            "ATX stands as living proof that online bonds can transcend the screen. It demonstrates that
                            a humble Werewolf circle can grow into a sanctuary where <span>loyalty, teamwork, and
                                heart</span> carry far more weight than any match score."
                        </blockquote>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>